LIBSHAOS - Libraries from Shaos (19.03.2021)
============================================

A number of useful libraries, created by different authors
and assembled by Alexander Shabarshin (http://www.shaos.net).
LIBMAN version 1.2 is included. For tests recompiling on 
real Sprinter you may use OrgASM by Igor Zhadinets.

*.ASM - test for library
*.DLL - binariy file of library
*.EXE - compiled test
*.INC - library definitions
*.TXT - library documentation

[+] - sources are available (send me request)
[-] - sources are hidden 

ANTONFNT.DLL [+] "Anton Enin Font" v1.2 (19.03.2021)
author: Anton Enin, modified by Shaos
   
   Library for text printing in 640x256 16-color mode (like 
   in Flex Navigator). Based on the APRINT.ZIP package.

TEST.DLL [+] "Sample Library" v1.2 (01.08.2002)
author: Alexander Shabarshin

   Simple test for DLL engine. Print on the screen called
   function. Sources are in the LIBMAN package.


http://sprinter.nedopc.org
